<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS FLAT AT $60-5/8 (FIM 306.10).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS FLAT AT $60-5/8 (FIM 306.10).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed flat at $60-5/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 306.10 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed down six markka at 306.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended $0-1/2 lower at $37-1/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 94.00 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.30  markka at 93.70.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Friday. In Helsinki on Friday, Rauma closed down 1.50 markka at 114.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
